The MIT licence above covers the Lua source, the build scripts, and the
textures and audio those scripts generate. All of that art is rasterised or
synthesised from a model in `build/` - none of it is Blizzard's.

Duskfall also plays several of Blizzard's own weather and thunder sounds by
FileDataID. Those files are not included here, not redistributed, and not
covered by this licence: they are already on the player's disk as part of the
game, and the addon only asks the client to play them. See
`## Licensing: reference, never redistribute` in RESUME.md.
